{"id":"n40080-1-20","stage":1,"title":"기쁨 · 快乐","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40080-1-20-1","ko":"아기가 정말 사랑스럽지요?","zh":"宝宝真的非常可爱吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사랑스럽지요?","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"사랑스럽다：可爱；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"사랑스럽다","audio":"/audio/5dbf35135abd52ef985a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15851","senseId":"1","lemma":"사랑스럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"5dbf35135abd52ef","term":"사랑스럽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/5dbf35135abd52ef985a.mp3","entryId":"15851","definition":"十分乖巧，惹人喜欢。","pronunciation":["사랑스럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/61f1e0b86cd3ceb9ddd5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40080-1-20-2","ko":"네. 아기를 볼 때마다 기쁨을 감출 수가 없어요.","zh":"是的。每次看到宝宝，我都忍不住感到开心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아기를","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기쁨을","meaning":"快乐，喜悦","explanation":"기쁨：快乐，喜悦；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기쁨","audio":"/audio/a9286a64cba92572f225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40080","senseId":"1","lemma":"기쁨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감출","meaning":"隐藏，隐瞒","explanation":"감추다：隐藏，隐瞒；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"감추다","audio":"/audio/6f882ecc870fa5a9c9ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15990","senseId":"2","lemma":"감추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"a9286a64cba92572","term":"기쁨","zh":"快乐，喜悦","audio":"/audio/a9286a64cba92572f225.mp3","entryId":"40080","definition":"心情非常好、十分愉快的感觉。","pronunciation":["기쁨"]},{"id":"6f882ecc870fa5a9","term":"감추다","zh":"隐藏，隐瞒","audio":"/audio/6f882ecc870fa5a9c9ef.mp3","entryId":"15990","definition":"把某个事实或感情当作秘密，不说出来，不让别人知道。","pronunciation":["감추다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e14c958907c92ccd523f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40080","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的。每次看到宝宝，我都忍不住感到开心。","不好意思，请问这附近有超市吗？","宝宝真的非常可爱吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的。每次看到宝宝，我都忍不住感到开心。","宝宝真的非常可爱吧？","不好意思，请问这附近有超市吗？"],"answer":0}]}
